      "message": "Actually, it is not: one board has one type of more than 256 region:\ncommon/flash.c:1068:3: error: large integer implicitly truncated to unsigned type [-Werror\u003doverflow]:\n\nnpcx eval board (npcx_evb) has 8MB of 4k page flash.\nI could improve flash.c to report several bank of the same size, but I think add 1 byte per bank is not a memory burden.\nWe will revisit when EC has more than 256MB.",
